{"suttaId":"thag1.21","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[130,133],"vripara":"21"},"segments":{"thag1.21:0.4":"Nigrodhattheragāthā","thag1.21:1.1":"“Nāhaṃ bhayassa bhāyāmi,","thag1.21:1.2":"satthā no amatassa kovido;","thag1.21:1.3":"Yattha bhayaṃ nāvatiṭṭhati,","thag1.21:1.4":"tena maggena vajanti bhikkhavo”ti. …","thag1.21:1.5":"Nigrodho thero…. 2."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":830,"to":830,"paras":[{"para":830,"vripara":"21","refs":["thag1.21:1"],"lines":["Tattha bhāyanti etasmāti <b>bhayaṃ,</b> jātijarādi.","<b>Bhayassā</b>ti nissakke sāmivacanaṃ, bhayato bhāyitabbanimittaṃ jātijarāmaraṇādinā hetunā nāhaṃ bhāyāmīti attho.","Tattha kāraṇamāha <b>“satthā no amatassa kovido”</b>ti.","Amhākaṃ satthā amate kusalo veneyyānaṃ amatadāne cheko.","<b>Yattha bhayaṃ nāvatiṭṭhatī</b>ti yasmiṃ nibbāne yathāvuttaṃ bhayaṃ na tiṭṭhati okāsaṃ na labhati.","<b>Tenā</b>ti tato nibbānato.","<b>Vajantī</b>ti abhayaṭṭhānameva gacchanti.","Nibbānañhi abhayaṭṭhānaṃ nāma.","Kena pana vajantīti āha <b>“maggena vajanti bhikkhavo”</b>ti, aṭṭhaṅgikena ariyamaggena satthu ovādakaraṇā bhikkhū saṃsāre bhayassa ikkhanakāti attho.","<b>Yatthā</b>ti vā yaṃ nimittaṃ yassa ariyamaggassa adhigamahetu attānuvādādikaṃ pañcavīsatividhampi bhayaṃ nāvatiṭṭhati patiṭṭhaṃ na labhati, tena ariyena maggena vajanti abhayaṭṭhānaṃ satthu sāsane bhikkhū, tena maggena ahampi gato, tasmā nāhaṃ bhayassa bhāyāmīti thero aññaṃ byākāsi."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"],["thag1.21:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.21:1.1","bhayaṃ",0,0],["thag1.21:1.3","bhayaṃ",0,0],["thag1.21:1.1","bhayassā",0,1],["thag1.21:1.1","satthā no amatassa kovido",0,2],["thag1.21:1.3","yattha bhayaṃ nāvatiṭṭhatī",0,4],["thag1.21:1.3","tenā",0,5],["thag1.21:1.3","vajantī",0,6],["thag1.21:1.3","maggena vajanti bhikkhavo",0,8],["thag1.21:1.3","yatthā",0,9]],"before":[{"para":764,"vripara":null,"title":"Tatiyavaggo","lines":["Tatiyavaggo 1."]},{"para":765,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":766,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Nāhaṃ</b> <b>bhayassa bhāyāmī</b>ti āyasmato nigrodhattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayaṃ kira ito aṭṭhārase kappasate brāhmaṇamahāsālakule nibbattitvā vayappatto kāmesu ādīnavaṃ nekkhamme ca ānisaṃsaṃ disvā gharabandhanaṃ pahāya araññāyatanaṃ pavisitvā aññatarasmiṃ sālavane paṇṇasālaṃ katvā tāpasapabbajaṃ pabbajitvā vanamūlaphalāhāro vasati.","Tena samayena piyadassī nāma sammāsambuddho loke uppajjitvā sadevakassa lokassa dhammāmatavassena kilesasantāpaṃ nibbāpento ekadivasaṃ tāpase anukampāya taṃ sālavanaṃ pavisitvā nirodhasamāpattiṃ samāpanno.","Tāpaso vanamūlaphalatthāya gacchanto bhagavantaṃ disvā pasannamānaso pupphitasāladaṇḍasākhāyo gahetvā sālamaṇḍapaṃ katvā taṃ sabbatthakameva sālapupphehi sañchādetvā bhagavantaṃ vanditvā pītisomanassavaseneva āhāratthāyapi agantvā namassamāno aṭṭhāsi.","Satthā nirodhato vuṭṭhāya tassa anukampāya “bhikkhusaṅgho āgacchatū”ti cintesi, “bhikkhusaṅghepi cittaṃ pasādessatī”ti.","Tāvadeva bhikkhusaṅgho āgato.","So bhikkhusaṅghampi disvā pasannamānaso vanditvā añjaliṃ paggayha aṭṭhāsi.","Satthā sitassa pātukaraṇāpadesena tassa bhāviniṃ sampattiṃ pakāsento dhammaṃ kathetvā pakkāmi saddhiṃ bhikkhusaṅghena.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesuyeva saṃsaranto vivaṭṭūpanissayaṃ bahuṃ kusalaṃ upacinitvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde sāvatthiyaṃ brāhmaṇamahāsālakule nibbatti, <b>nigrodho</b>tissa nāmaṃ ahosi.","So jetavanapaṭiggahaṇadivase buddhānubhāvadassanena sañjātappasādo pabbajitvā vipassanaṃ ārabhitvā nacirasseva chaḷabhiñño ahosi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 2.49.190-220) –"]},{"para":767,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ajjhogāhetvā sālavanaṃ, sukato assamo mama;"]},{"para":768,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sālapupphehi sañchanno, vasāmi vipine tadā."]},{"para":769,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Piyadassī ca bhagavā, sayambhū aggapuggalo;"]},{"para":770,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vivekakāmo sambuddho, sālavanamupāgami."]},{"para":771,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Assamā abhinikkhamma, pavanaṃ agamāsahaṃ;"]},{"para":772,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mūlaphalaṃ gavesanto, āhindāmi vane tadā."]},{"para":773,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, piyadassiṃ mahāyasaṃ;"]},{"para":774,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sunisinnaṃ samāpannaṃ, virocantaṃ mahāvane."]},{"para":775,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catudaṇḍe ṭhapetvāna, buddhassa uparī ahaṃ;"]},{"para":776,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Maṇḍapaṃ sukataṃ katvā, sālapupphehi chādayiṃ."]},{"para":777,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sattāhaṃ dhārayitvāna, maṇḍapaṃ sālachāditaṃ;"]},{"para":778,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, buddhaseṭṭhamavandahaṃ."]},{"para":779,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Bhagavā tamhi samaye, vuṭṭhahitvā samādhito;"]},{"para":780,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yugamattaṃ pekkhamāno, nisīdi purisuttamo."]},{"para":781,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sāvako varuṇo nāma, piyadassissa satthuno;"]},{"para":782,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vasīsatasahassehi, upagacchi vināyakaṃ."]},{"para":783,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Piyadassī ca bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;"]},{"para":784,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, sitaṃ pātukarī jino."]},{"para":785,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anuruddho upaṭṭhāko, piyadassissa satthuno;"]},{"para":786,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ekaṃsaṃ cīvaraṃ katvā, apucchittha mahāmuniṃ."]},{"para":787,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ko nu kho bhagavā hetu, sitakammassa satthuno;"]},{"para":788,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Kāraṇe vijjamānamhi, satthā pātukare sitaṃ."]},{"para":789,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sattāhaṃ sālacchadanaṃ, yo me dhāresi māṇavo;"]},{"para":790,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tassa kammaṃ saritvāna, sitaṃ pātukariṃ ahaṃ."]},{"para":791,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anokāsaṃ na passāmi, yattha puññaṃ vipaccati;"]},{"para":792,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Devaloke manusse vā, okāsova na sammati."]},{"para":793,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Devaloke vasantassa, puññakammasamaṅgino;"]},{"para":794,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yāvatā parisā tassa, sālacchannā bhavissati."]},{"para":795,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tattha dibbehi naccehi, gītehi vāditehi ca;"]},{"para":796,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ramissati sadā santo, puññakammasamāhito."]},{"para":797,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yāvatā parisā tassa, gandhagandhī bhavissati;"]},{"para":798,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sālassa pupphavasso ca, pavassissati tāvade."]},{"para":799,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tato cutoyaṃ manujo, mānusaṃ āgamissati;"]},{"para":800,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, sabbakālaṃ dharissati."]},{"para":801,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Idha naccañca gītañca, sammatāḷasamāhitaṃ;"]},{"para":802,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parivāressanti maṃ niccaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":803,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Uggacchante ca sūriye, sālavassaṃ pavassate;"]},{"para":804,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Puññakammena saṃyuttaṃ, vassate sabbakālikaṃ."]},{"para":805,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, okkākakulasambhavo;"]},{"para":806,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gotamo nāma nāmena, satthā loke bhavissati."]},{"para":807,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tassa dhamme sudāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;"]},{"para":808,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo."]},{"para":809,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Dhammaṃ abhisamentassa, sālacchannaṃ bhavissati;"]},{"para":810,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Citake jhāyamānassa, chadanaṃ tattha hessati."]},{"para":811,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Vipākaṃ kittayitvāna, piyadassī mahāmuni;"]},{"para":812,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parisāya dhammaṃ desesi, tappento dhammavuṭṭhiyā."]},{"para":813,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiṃsakappāni devesu, devarajjamakārayiṃ;"]},{"para":814,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Saṭṭhi ca sattakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ."]},{"para":815,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Devalokā idhāgantvā, labhāmi vipulaṃ sukhaṃ;"]},{"para":816,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, maṇḍapassa idaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":817,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ayaṃ pacchimako mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;"]},{"para":818,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, hessati sabbakālikaṃ."]},{"para":819,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mahāmuniṃ tosayitvā, gotamaṃ sakyapuṅgavaṃ;"]},{"para":820,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ."]},{"para":821,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;"]},{"para":822,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":823,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;"]},{"para":824,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo."]},{"para":825,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, buddhaseṭṭhassa santike;"]},{"para":826,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ."]},{"para":827,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;"]},{"para":828,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":829,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Evaṃ pana chaḷabhiñño hutvā phalasukhena vītināmento sāsanassa niyyānikabhāvavibhāvanatthaṃ aññābyākaraṇavasena <b>“nāhaṃ bhayassa bhāyāmī”</b>ti gāthaṃ abhāsi. 21."]}],"after":[{"para":831,"vripara":null,"title":"Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Nigrodhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 2."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
